{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/43cbed903fb9a0777a0679ff08660cc8.avif?t=1757421347\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a pineapple</strong>, and as such, your only goal is to <strong>reach the stars</strong>. Use your <strong>platforming</strong> skills to jump around unique biomes, from island to island or wall to wall, to reach every star each world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pineapple, you are dropped into a random world with <strong>3 stars</strong> to reach. You can run and jump around the world (and off walls!) to reach the stars using the terrain provided. On your way, you can find <strong>hints</strong>, which <strong>will point towards the nearest (unclaimed) star</strong>. They also conveniently reset after each star is collected, so they can be used again for the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will find <strong>5 unique biomes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The grassy biome</strong> provides a simple shape for navigation and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The purple mossy biome</strong> includes small platforms with long, punishing drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The desert</strong> holds large empty spaces, which can be either powerful or detrimental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clouds</strong> are easy and peaceful, only requiring some wall jumps in tough places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rocky biome</strong> is a mixture of elements, providing a balanced yet challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, <strong>your time</strong> <strong>to get all 3 stars will be counted</strong>. Compete for the best time on the daily seed. <strong>Global leaderboards</strong> show the best times of all players. If you'd rather play on your own, you can choose a <strong>custom seed</strong> or a <strong>random seed</strong>, and see how fast you can get your first attempts at a given world's stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/2557ee1c0cac3c73812bbede7a90f36e.avif?t=1757421347\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992220?t=1757421347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992220?t=1757421347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/c89323899e7a40fc97448989ff638b17fd467eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757421347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/c89323899e7a40fc97448989ff638b17fd467eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757421347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/43cbed903fb9a0777a0679ff08660cc8.avif?t=1757421347\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a pineapple</strong>, and as such, your only goal is to <strong>reach the stars</strong>. Use your <strong>platforming</strong> skills to jump around unique biomes, from island to island or wall to wall, to reach every star each world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pineapple, you are dropped into a random world with <strong>3 stars</strong> to reach. You can run and jump around the world (and off walls!) to reach the stars using the terrain provided. On your way, you can find <strong>hints</strong>, which <strong>will point towards the nearest (unclaimed) star</strong>. They also conveniently reset after each star is collected, so they can be used again for the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will find <strong>5 unique biomes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The grassy biome</strong> provides a simple shape for navigation and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The purple mossy biome</strong> includes small platforms with long, punishing drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The desert</strong> holds large empty spaces, which can be either powerful or detrimental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clouds</strong> are easy and peaceful, only requiring some wall jumps in tough places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rocky biome</strong> is a mixture of elements, providing a balanced yet challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, <strong>your time</strong> <strong>to get all 3 stars will be counted</strong>. Compete for the best time on the daily seed. <strong>Global leaderboards</strong> show the best times of all players. If you'd rather play on your own, you can choose a <strong>custom seed</strong> or a <strong>random seed</strong>, and see how fast you can get your first attempts at a given world's stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra